OL,3,GNEWSALimit reduced for branded school
OL,4,Auniform items
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school uniform policy limiting States
OL,7,Fschools to five branded uniform items
OL,8,Fper child has been put in place.
OL,10,FThe States said this should be "a
OL,11,Fwelcome relief" to families as some
OL,12,Fschools require 11 branded items of
OL,13,Fclothing, costing hundreds to pay for
OL,14,Funiform, PE kit and equipment.
OL,16,FThe policy was announced in 2023, with
OL,17,Fschools needing to comply by next month
OL,18,Fin time for the new school term.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
