OL,3,GNEWSALimit reduced for branded school
OL,4,Auniform items
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the UK, from September uniforms are
OL,7,Fbeing limited to three items with a
OL,8,Fschool logo, saving parents an
OL,9,Festimated #50 per child.
